<title>DUBAI: Reuters 23rd ex-Dubai air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 23rd ex-Dubai air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex- Dubai air cargo market rates in United Arab Emirates dirhams per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>			 June 2	     April 21</p>
<p>				   EUROPE</p>
<p>    DXB-LHR	   4.15		4.20</p>
<p>    DXB-FRA	   4.15		4.20</p>
<p>				ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p>    DXB-SIN	   4.00		4.00</p>
<p>    DXB-HKG	   4.00		4.00</p>
<p>				  AFRICA</p>
<p>    DXB-NBO	   4.30		4.15</p>
<p>			     UNITED STATES</p>
<p>    DXB-JFK	   6.40		6.50</p>
<p>    DXB-LAX	   7.45		7.60</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in the report were obtained by Reuter journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>*A UAE dirham is fixed at a rate of $0.27. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
</text>
